{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】英國曼徹斯特一場演唱會懷疑有人放出不明物質，場內超過一萬二千人需要緊急疏散。</p>\n<p>事發在當地周二晚上十時後，當時演唱會接近尾聲，部分觀眾突然不適，懷疑有人發放催淚氣體，超過50人即場接受檢查，主要是眼及呼吸道不適，其中一人需要送院。警方列為「重大事件」調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.784436+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:11:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:36:53.023604+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:14.043781+00:00","content_hash":"17b87f50b4e0487398573f86d2c5e493b66ef0fa30d0b8e6aad6fcddd666f4a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}